('sec-th-th-new-20-works', 'doc-new-theorist-20', 'works', 'ÏóÏ½ÏºÏ▒ ┘ê Ï¬Ïú┘ä█î┘üÏºÏ¬', 'از مهم‌ترین آثار فاریس: ۱) Dissent and Revolution in a Digital Age: Social Media, Blogging and Activism in Egypt (Londres: I.B. Tauris, 2013؛ ISBN 9781780761503 و 9780755607839) — کتاب اصلی و نخستین اثر او؛ ۲) Social Media in Iran: Politics and Society after 2009، ویراستار مشترک با بباب راهیمی (SUNY Press, 2015؛ ISBN 9781438458847) — به‌عنوان ویراستار و نویسندهٔ مقدمه و فصل «Architectures of Control and Mobilization in Egypt and Iran» (DOI: 10.1515/9781438458847-012)؛ ۳) Resolusio... — مقالات محوری: «Revolutions Without Revolutionaries? Network Theory, Facebook, and the Egyptian Blogosphere» (Arab Media & Society, 2009؛ DOI: 10.70090/df09rwrn)؛ «The end of the beginning: The failure of April 6th and the future of electronic activism in Egypt» (Arab Media & Society, 2009؛ DOI: 10.70090/dmf09eae)؛ «(Amplified) Voices for the Voiceless» (Arab Media & Society, 2010؛ DOI: 10.70090/df10av4v)؛ «Mediating Tyranny: Reimagining Authoritarian Media Systems in the Digital Age» (SSRN preprint, 2010)؛ «Revolutions Without Revolutionaries? Social Media Networks and Regime Response in Egypt» (dissertation, University of Pennsylvania, 2010؛ در ScholarlyCommons)؛ «The Arab Spring: U.S. Democracy Promotion in Egypt» با ارن اسنایدر (Middle East Policy, 2011؛ DOI: 10.1111/j.1475-4967.2011.00497.x)؛ «Beyond \'Social Media Revolutions\'. The Arab Spring and the Networked Revolt» (Politique étrangère, 2012؛ DOI: 10.3917/pe.121.0099)؛ «The digital divide in China, Hong Kong and Taiwan» (در The Digital Divide, ed. Ragnedda & Muschert, Routledge, 2013؛ DOI: 10.4324/9780203069769-19)؛ «Deep State, Deep Crisis: Egypt and American Policy» (Middle East Policy, 2013؛ DOI: 10.1111/mepo.12049)؛ «Multiplicities of Purpose: The Auditorium Building, the State, and the Transformation of Arab Digital Media» (International Journal of Middle East Studies, 2015؛ DOI: 10.1017/s0020743815000082)؛ «New Media and Democracy in the Arab World» (فصل در دانشنامهٔ Elsevier, 2015؛ DOI: 10.1016/b978-0-08-097086-8.95085-2)؛ و در سطح کلان، نقد The Fourth Wave (Howard & Hussain) در The Middle East Journal (2014) و نقد کتابش در Choice Reviews (2014) و European Journal of Communication (2014: DOI: 10.1177/0267323114531873g).', NULL, 15, 'group3', '2026-11-10 09:52:39', '2026-11-10 09:52:39'),
